<title>CANADA: Abitibi, Stone in merger talks.</title>
<headline>Abitibi, Stone in merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abitibi-Price Inc and Stone-Consolidated Corp said on Friday they were in talks on a possible merger.</p>
<p>The companies said there was no assurance that a deal would be reached.</p>
<p>Rumors about merger talks between the two forest products companies have been circulating for several days.</p>
<p>Stone-Consolidated is 47 percent-owned by Stone Container Corp.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
